{"id":"vulkan","lemma":"Vulkan","pos":"noun","rank":4712,"glosses":["volcano"],"ipa":"/vʊlˈkaːn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/aa/De-Vulkan.ogg/De-Vulkan.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Vulkans","plural":"Vulkane"},"formAudio":{"Vulkans":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/43/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Vulkans.wav","Vulkane":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Vulkane.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich will einen Vulkan sehen.","en":"I want to see a volcano.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to see"}]},{"text":"Der Vulkan ist wieder aktiv.","en":"The volcano has become active again.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"again"},{"g":"active"}]},{"text":"Es ist gefährlich, in der Nähe eines Vulkans zu leben.","en":"It's dangerous to live near a volcano.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"dangerous, hazardous"},null,null,null,{"g":"a, an","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"a state in which…"}],"phrases":[[3,6,"near"]]},{"text":"Der Vulkan kann jederzeit ausbrechen.","en":"The volcano may erupt at any moment.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"anytime"},{"g":"to break out"}]},{"text":"Der Vulkan ist heuer zweimal ausgebrochen.","en":"The volcano has erupted twice this year.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"this year"},{"g":"twice"},{"g":"to break out","l":"ausbrechen"}]}]}